     "loc": "src/main/java/com/getjobs/application/service/LiepinService.java:42-79",
     "text": "服务在 PostConstruct 或运行路径重复执行 CREATE、ALTER、DROP 兼容 DDL，异常被忽略或仅 warn 后继续；Flyway 与运行时逻辑双轨。"
